================================================================================
状态映射表 (Status → Class Mapping)
================================================================================

| status   | progress_class | badge_class | row_class    | delta颜色      |
|----------|----------------|-------------|--------------|----------------|
| 已达标   | achieved/blue  | achieved    | tr-achieved  | achieved/green |
| 需关注   | attention/warning | attention | tr-attention | attention/red  |
| 需加强   | improve/danger | improve     | tr-improve   | improve/red    |
| 无数据   | nodata/gray    | nodata      | tr-nodata    | nodata/gray    |

================================================================================
